# Coverage directory used by tools like istanbul.
#
# Anchored. Unanchored, `coverage` ignores a directory of that name at ANY
# depth — it silently swallowed src/services/intel/coverage, and the only
# reason that surfaced is guard-untracked-imports, which noticed four files
# importing something no clone would contain. The istanbul output is at the
# root and always has been.
/coverage
*.lcov

# nyc test coverage
.nyc_output

# Test outputs and artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
*.junit.xml

